.TH NIS-PROBE 1 "2026-10-13" "SASD Freeware" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nis-probe \- local nis/yp binding diagnosis
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nis-probe
[options] [--help | --version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read-only local NIS server binding check via ypwhich. No maps, user accounts or group membership are requested. Client availability differs by OS. NIS is a legacy insecure protocol.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --domain DOMAIN
Use explicit NIS domain instead of the local default.
.TP
.B --timeout 1..10
Maximum native operation budget plus safety margin.
.TP
.B --help
Display help and exit.
.TP
.B --version
Display version and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success/clean; 1 unsuccessful/finding; 2 invalid arguments; 3 missing prerequisites or unexpected errors.
.SH SECURITY
Only read-only checks. Query tools can send network traffic; configure only authorized targets.
